["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasDeletedFile", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Every `to` Element is a file deleted from the `from` Element (`from` hasDeletedFile `to`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
